// Optional user input overrides applied AFTER DMS-generated input.kdl.
// Use this file for pointing-device settings that should take precedence over
// DMS controls. The legacy input.kdl is applied BEFORE DMS to retain its
// keyboard settings and provide fallback pointing-device settings.
//
// Example:
// input {
//     touchpad {
//         accel-speed 0.2
//     }
// }
